UPSTREAM ATTRIBUTION

This project began as an adaptation of:

    codebase-to-course — Copyright (c) Zara Zhang
    https://github.com/zarazhangrui/codebase-to-course

Parts of `references/styles.css`, `references/main.js`, `references/_base.html`
and `references/_footer.html` are that project's work, carried over with
modifications. The structure of SKILL.md and the reference documents also
derives from it, although their content has been rewritten.

**That repository publishes no licence file.** At the time of writing, GitHub
reports no licence for it, which under default copyright means no permission to
copy, modify or redistribute has been granted. The MIT grant above therefore
covers only this project's own contributions, and cannot and does not grant
rights over the upstream material.

If you intend to use, fork or redistribute this project, seek permission from
the upstream author for the parts derived from their work.

