BUNDLED FONTS

`references/fonts/` contains two typefaces, both under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1, redistributed under its terms. Their full licence texts travel
with them:

    LXGW WenKai 霞鹜文楷 — references/fonts/LICENSE-LXGWWenKai-OFL.txt
    JetBrains Mono      — references/fonts/LICENSE-JetBrainsMono-OFL.txt

The npm package that repackages LXGW WenKai as webfonts is separately MIT:
references/fonts/LICENSE-LXGWWenKai-webfont-packaging-MIT.txt
